id: seething-fury-you-must-die-by-my-hand
name: You Must Die by My Hand!
order: 2
slot: burst
description: >
  Your burning rage has no limits, and you will make sure that anyone who opposes you doesn't live to regret it.
text: >
  You Must Die by My Hand!: Your burning rage has no limits, and you will make sure that anyone who opposes you doesn't live to regret it.
  (1)-[Triggered/Transform]: Maximize your stacks of Overwhelm. If you do, you may use the Basic Attack Maneuver or Signature Technique Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. Apply the bonus to Wound Rolls from your stacks of Overwhelm an additional time to this Attacking Maneuver.

